  "description": "An Ace SE is a petite Ace, with\n\nsmaller-diameter wheels, proportionately narrower handlebars and shorter crank\n\narms, and reach-adjustable brake levers. Ace SE is designed for people whose\n\nheight is not huge. Because the SE was, from the drawing board, intended for\n\nshort folks, it looks \"right.\" Harmonious. Graceful.\n\nLike its bigger brethren, the Ace SE frame is made of Cro-moly steel, and\n\nit comes with the same handsome aero style steel fork. Even though it is proportionally small, the Ace SE frame\n\nstill has room for two bottle cage mounts, as well as attachments for a luggage\n\nrack and even fenders.\n\nLike the Ace, the Ace SE features Shimano Sora components and three chain\n\nrings up front for pretty much any gear you could possibly need.",
